WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:06.920
Your stop gets hit. And then price runs exactly your way?

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:10.650
That's not bad luck. That's liquidity.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:15.690
Step one: most traders put their stop below the obvious low.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:22.110
Step two: big players grab exactly those stops. Then the market turns.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.910
Step three: only enter after the sweep. Not before.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.510
No time to analyze this yourself?

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:36.280
Gold ideas live on Telegram. Comment GOLD and I'll send you the link.
